RELAXED_BOX 71.9415737150414 71.9482307001331 71.9561887435094

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-168.877802352287)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-168.877802352287)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
